   ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   ⚠ SCAFFOLD (scripts/new-activity.js). A running skeleton: three cards,
   tap the one that matches, Check. Replace render/_paint/the CSS with the
   invention from docs/activities-rebuild/new/__NUM__-__KEY__.md. Keep:
   the nextTask reshuffle (≥ 7 rounds, order-only, never the same order
   twice), answerType 'state', the test seams, apparatusClasses, no words
   on the apparatus, library pictures only (LCSPictures), 0 lines to
   lcs-shell.* or any shared core. Strings: every key in all 11 locales —
   the EN source first, the others by hand, then ONE native + pedagogy
   reviewer. fr uses a real U+202F before ? : ! ; and inside « ».
   Test seams: window.__ACT__.st / ._order / ._pool.
   ===================================================================== */
